# AI repository instructions

Read AGENTS.md before editing this site. For EVERY player lineup artwork generation or edit, read and follow docs/lineup-artwork-protocol.md and its referenced style/proportion rules. Use the actual approved full-body reference and official player headshot; preserve proportions for regular and alternate poses alike. Follow the owner's fast publish workflow. Do not add publishing gates, review-evidence files or extra approval steps.

Manager artwork uses assets/MANAGER_ARTWORK_RULES.md. NEVER cut out, paste, composite, fit, or independently resize heads onto bodies. Generate each complete pose as one coherent image with a naturally connected head, shaded neck, collar, and body. Original manager figures are visual references, not body layers for head replacement. Honor any explicit preview-before-publication request.
